{"id":"n90483-1-9","stage":5,"title":"동상 · 铜像","scene":"文化与休闲","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90483-1-9-1","ko":"저 동상의 주인공은 누구인가요?","zh":"那座雕像塑造的是谁？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동상의","meaning":"铜像","explanation":"동상：铜像；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"동상","audio":"/audio/3f5cbb0bc85686a0662f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90483","senseId":"1","lemma":"동상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주인공은","meaning":"主人公，主角","explanation":"주인공：主人公，主角；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"주인공","audio":"/audio/4b72fe4264a8ed541f2c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62472","senseId":"1","lemma":"주인공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"누구인가요?","meaning":"谁","explanation":"누구：谁；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"누구","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62078","senseId":"1","lemma":"누구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71214","definition":"指代离说话人和听话人较远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"3f5cbb0bc85686a0","term":"동상","zh":"铜像","audio":"/audio/3f5cbb0bc85686a0662f.mp3","entryId":"90483","definition":"按照人或动物的形象做成的纪念物，多用铜制作而成。","pronunciation":["동상"]},{"id":"4b72fe4264a8ed54","term":"주인공","zh":"主人公，主角","audio":"/audio/4b72fe4264a8ed541f2c.mp3","entryId":"62472","definition":"在话剧、电影、小说等里成为故事核心的人物。","pronunciation":["주인공"]},{"id":"e9e6266b8035d7c4","term":"누구","zh":"谁","audio":"/audio/e9e6266b8035d7c474ee.mp3","entryId":"62078","definition":"指不认识的人。","pronunciation":["누구"]}],"audio":"/audio/c9f020d3e52c59f602eb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90483-1-9-2","ko":"이 학교를 설립한 사람이란다.","zh":"是创办这所学校的人。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"학교를","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"설립한","meaning":"设立，创办","explanation":"설립하다：设立，创办；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"설립하다","audio":"/audio/a41e31144d7ce71835a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45000","senseId":"1","lemma":"설립하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람이란다.","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；란다：向平辈或晚辈说明自己知道或听到的情况。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3","entryId":"73276","definition":"按照一定的目标、教育课程、制度等，教师对学生进行教育的机构。","pronunciation":["학꾜"]},{"id":"a41e31144d7ce718","term":"설립하다","zh":"设立，创办","audio":"/audio/a41e31144d7ce71835a2.mp3","entryId":"45000","definition":"新建团体或机构等。","pronunciation":["설리파다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]}],"audio":"/audio/d42874ae63ae2e1b0961.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.175,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90483","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급",